of her legs, particularly after long sitting or standing 
times and after exposure to coldness with symptom on-
set about one year prior to admission. She had a history 
of musicogenic reflex epilepsy for 30 years, treated with 
phenytoine 300 mg daily, and no more than two seizures</seg> 
